{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1382527-reminder-about-vampire-novels","id":1382527,"title":"Reminder about Vampire novels","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-19T08:01:54-07:00","id":1382527,"title":"Reminder about Vampire novels","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Hi there!</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">I GM for what use to be a Victorian age vampire campaign, but after 5 weeks of quarantine, we have </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">played</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> a lot of skype role and we\u2019re reaching the 1990\u2019s.</span></span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">I would like to add an adventure around the facts happening in the clan novels. I read them 20 years ago, and I don\u2019t have time read all novels before preparing the next adventures. Could you help me </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">refreshig</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> my mind?</span></span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">I\u2019ll write here what I remember, SPOILER ALERT.</span></span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">-SABBAT: Moncada and </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Vyckos</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> are the brain behind a plot to conquer the East Coast. They start in Atlanta and go up until Washington DC, where Theo Bell kills Vitel. Camarilla conquers NYC, </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Calebros</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> is the Prince. What happened to all other cities?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">-SPAIN: </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Lucita</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> and Fatima kill Moncada... because... because no real reason, right?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">-HAZIMEL, is a powerful 4</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">th</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> generation </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Ravnos</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">, who lost his eye. A random Toreador finds it, kills many </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Gangrels</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> and Xavier makes the </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Gangrels</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> leave the Camarilla.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">-ANATOL: Follows the eye of </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Hazimel</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">, finds the above toreador, puts the eye in his head and suicides for unknown reasons.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">-CAMARILLA: big guys from </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Camarialla</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> are focused on resisting the Sabbat crusade, Nosferatu and Toreador </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Justicars</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> are somehow involved in this.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">-TREMERE: Something happened in NYC chapel, with Aisling, I don\u2019t remember what.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">-PARMENIDES: Is a young </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Assamite</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">, </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Vyckos</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"> captures and tortures with no impact in the story at all, right?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">-RUDELZ: is a merchant </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Setite</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">, with no impact in the story.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Anything else? Anything I am </span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">misremembering</span></span><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">? </span></span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">THANKS</span></span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11010-ersito","name":"erSito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11010_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-19T08:27:48-07:00","id":1382530,"title":"","content":"You're mostly accurate.<br /> <br /> However, I should point out that CROSSROAD PRESS re-released the Clan Novels on Kindle and in print form.<br /> <br /> They're available on Amazon and their website.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&